{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">羅天宇昨日（1日）迎來39歲生日，人緣極佳的他獲大批圈中好友到場慶祝。事後他在社交平台分享多張生日慶祝花絮照，其中最吸睛的莫過於他與陳懿德首度大方放閃。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">與陳懿德感情愈愛愈高調的他，今次在社交網首度大發閃光彈，公開兩人的親密合照。相中所見，羅天宇右手捧着生日蛋糕，左手溫馨地攬着陳懿德，兩人更Sweet爆頭貼頭合照，幸福之情溢於言表，瞬間閃盲一班網民。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"65b0496f-a878-43d5-94e9-642ce46213d2.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026WRL3hrdLHJ1790933652.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"65b0496f-a878-43d5-94e9-642ce46213d2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f61b4cef-eaae-45bf-91ad-de207a39c2d7.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026hmTqQ7iVbi1790933651.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f61b4cef-eaae-45bf-91ad-de207a39c2d7.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">此外，合照中陳懿德手捧可愛狗仔並嘟嘴賣萌，畫面極具溫馨感，被網民形容宛如「一家三口」的全家福照，非常美滿甜蜜。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T09:58:34.978154+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":232,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}